QuestGuidance.Register("es",245,{
[7809]="70062F20\n1\tSpeak with the Krahjarn emissary\tYou may seek the blessing of the Krahjarn clan. All you need do is renounce all other clans.\n",
[7810]="7004A9DA\n1\tDefeat Dulgan\tDefeat Dulgan.\n2\tTalk to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.\n",
[7811]="7004A9E5\n1\tElimina a las arañas\tDefeat spiders.\n2\tDerrota arañas (total: 15)\tDefeat spiders.\n3\tTalk to Candúr\tTalk to Candúr.\n",
[7812]="7004A9E3\n1\tGather silk\tGather silk.\n2\tGather silk (total: 8)\tGather silk.\n3\tBring the silk to Candúr\tBring the silk to Candúr.\n",
[7813]="70050A0B\n1\tDefeat Káldbak, Scourge of the Withered Heath\tKáldbak poses a great threat to all that enter the Withered Heath.\n2\tDefeat Káldbak, Scourge of the Withered Heath\tKáldbak poses a great threat to all that enter the Withered Heath.\n3\tCompletado\tKáldbak poses a great threat to all that enter the Withered Heath.\n",
[7814]="7003FE0F\n1\tPlant banners at Kêr Bras (total: 6)\tKêr Bras is within the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Avordur asked you to venture to Kêr Bras within the Paths of the Dead and plant several banners of Gondor to show you do not fear the Ruthless Dead.\n2\tHabla con Avordur\tAvordur is in Dol Amroth, far to the south of the Paths of the Dead. Avordur will be pleased to hear you planted the banners within Kêr Bras.\n",
[7815]="7003FE12\n1\tGather Blooms of Decay from Kêr Bras (total: 6)\tBlooms of Decay can be found at Kêr Bras, inside the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Avordur asked you to gather several Blooms of Decay from Kêr Bras.\n2\tHabla con Avordur\tAvordur is in Dol Amroth, far to the south of the Paths of the Dead. Avordur will be pleased to begin working on the Blooms of Decay you recovered.\n",
[7816]="7003FE11\n1\tLacquer the ground beneath quieted Ruthless Oathbreakers at Kêr Bras (total: 6)\tKêr Bras is within the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Avordur asked you to apply a lacquer to the ground beneath any Ruthless Dead you quiet. This should prevent any taint.\n2\tHabla con Avordur\tAvordur is in Dol Amroth, far to the south of the Paths of the Dead. Avordur will be interested to hear if the lacquer worked.\n",
[7817]="7003FE10\n1\tQuiet Ruthless Dead at Kêr Bras (total: 10)\tRuthless Dead are at Kêr Bras, within the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Avordur asked you to quiet as many Ruthless Dead within Kêr Bras as you can manage.\n2\tHabla con Avordur\tAvordur is in Dol Amroth, far to the south of the Paths of the Dead. Avordur will be pleased you quieted many Ruthless Dead within Kêr Bras.\n",
[7818]="7003FE0D\n1\tRecover remains from Kêr Izel (total: 8)\tFallen adventurers can be found at Kêr Izel, within Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Golusel asked you to return any remains of those you found within the Paths of the Dead.\n2\tHabla con Golusel\tGolusel is in Dol Amroth. Golusel will be eager to properly bury the remains you have recovered.\n",
[7819]="7003FE0A\n1\tRemove ruthless rune-stones from Lenn Dûskud (total: 8)\tLenn Dûskud, a small pond, is at Kêr Izel, within the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Golusel asked you to venture to a pond within the Paths of the Dead and clear it of any foul objects.\n2\tHabla con Golusel\tGolusel is in Dol Amroth. Golusel will be pleased to hear the waters have been cleansed.\n",
[7820]="7003FE0E\n1\tDefeat Ruthless Dead in Kêr Izel (total: 10)\tRuthless Dead can be found within Kêr Izel, in the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Golusel asked you to quiet the Ruthless Dead within the lower city of the Paths of the Dead.\n2\tHabla con Golusel\tGolusel is in Dol Amroth. Golusel will be pleased to hear many Ruthless Dead have been quieted.\n",
[7821]="7003FE0C\n1\tDefeat Ruthless Banner-bearers at the Shadow-watch (total: 3)\tThe Shadow-watch is within Kêr Izel, in the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth. Golusel asked you to venture to the Paths of the Dead and disperse some Ruthless Dead who are preying on travellers from an overlook.\n2\tHabla con Golusel\tGolusel is in Dol Amroth. Golusel will be pleased to hear the Paths of the Dead should be safer for a period of time.\n",
[7822]="70072C05\n1\tDefeat Rátinur and Gáthtrag Gloomhammer\tKôth Rau is a bastion for those who wish to subjugate the populace in An Shêru. Seek out and defeat the leaders within.\n2\tDefeat Sorceress Ombátha\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Sorceress Ombátha and defeat her.\n3\tDefeat Râkdakul\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Râkdakul and defeat the foul creature.\n",
[7823]="70072C02\n1\tDefeat Rátinur and Gáthtrag Gloomhammer\tKôth Rau is a bastion for those who wish to subjugate the populace in An Shêru. Seek out and defeat the leaders within.\n2\tDefeat Sorceress Ombátha\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Sorceress Ombátha and defeat her.\n3\tDefeat Râkdakul\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Râkdakul and defeat the foul creature.\n",
[7824]="70072C04\n1\tDefeat Rátinur and Gáthtrag Gloomhammer\tKôth Rau is a bastion for those who wish to subjugate the populace in An Shêru. Seek out and defeat the leaders within.\n2\tDefeat Sorceress Ombátha\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Sorceress Ombátha and defeat her.\n3\tDefeat Râkdakul\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Râkdakul and defeat the foul creature.\n",
[7825]="70072C03\n1\tDefeat Rátinur and Gáthtrag Gloomhammer\tKôth Rau is a bastion for those who wish to subjugate the populace in An Shêru. Seek out and defeat the leaders within.\n2\tDefeat Sorceress Ombátha\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Sorceress Ombátha and defeat her.\n3\tDefeat Râkdakul\tAs you further explore Kôth Rau, seek out Râkdakul and defeat the foul creature.\n",
[7826]="70019606\n1\tMuestra la reina de las moscas del pantano a alguien en el Refugio del Cazador\tEl Refugio del Cazador está al este de Archet. Debes llevar el cadáver de la reina de las moscas del pantano al Refugio del Cazador para ver si alguien tiene más información para ti.\n",
[7827]="7005AAA7\n1\tFind Molkha\tMolkha has been sent to find the frost-drakes inside the Pit of Stonejaws. You should find Molkha somewhere in the tunnels east of Bárgstad.\n2\tComplete 'Quelling the Horde'\030Complete 'If You Want to Make a Hearty Egg Breakfast...'\030Complete 'Food for Their Young'\030Complete 'Frost-bound Nest-tenders'\030Find information about Loknashra\tMolkha needs your help.\n3\tTalk to Molkha\tYou should return to Molkha.\n",
[7828]="70000176\n1\tEscolta a Lalia hasta un lugar seguro.\tDebes llevar a Lalia a la Puerta Norte de las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Lalia te ha pedido que la ayudes a regresar a Bree sana y salva. Además, te ha pedido ayuda para encontrar la capa que perdió en algún lugar de las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Debes protegerla mientras busca su capa y luego escoltarla fuera de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.\n2\tLleva la capa de Lalia a Bob.\tBob puede encontrarse en el Camino del Bosque Viejo, entre las Quebradas de los Túmulos y el Bosque Viejo. Has ayudado a Lalia a regresar a casa. En agradecimiento, te ha dado su capa. Te ha pedido que se la lleves a su padre, Bob, el asistente de Cebadilla Mantecona, como prueba de que está a salvo. No tuviste corazón para decirle que Bob la estaba buscando dentro de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.\n",
[7829]="7006E4C6\n1\tAcércate a Lalia\tSe esperaba que Lalia estuviera entre los Túmulos del Norte y el Pináculo de los Caídos, donde se dice que el \"Último Príncipe\" fue enterrado, y es exactamente allí donde la encontraste. Deberías acercarte a la niña llorando.\n2\tHabla con Lalia\tHas encontrado a Lalia entre los Túmulos del Norte y el Pináculo de los Caídos, como se esperaba. Deberías hablar con la niña llorando.\n3\tEscolta a Lalia hasta un lugar seguro.\tLalia te ha pedido que la ayudes a regresar a Bree de manera segura. Además, te ha pedido ayuda para encontrar la capa que dejó caer en algún lugar de la Quebrada de los Túmulos. Debes protegerla mientras busca su capa y luego abandona la Quebrada de los Túmulos.\n",
[7830]="7002658D\n1\tHonra a los Montaraces caídos (total: 5)\tMuchos Montaraces han caído mientras defendían la ciudad de Angmar. Deberían ser honrados.\n2\tHabla con Orchalwë\tOrchalwë se alegrará de saber que honraste a los Montaraces caídos.\n",
[7831]="70047BC5\n1\tCarefully collect a sample of Trollstrife\tTrollstrife can be found on the sides of trees in the Noman-lands. Mílgamel has asked you to gather Trollstrife and then meet her at Haerondir in the Noman-lands.\n2\tDeliver the Trollstrife to Mílgamel at Haerondir\tMílgamel can be found at Haerondir in the eastern reaches of the Noman-lands. You have carefully gathered the Trollstrife and should now deliver it to Mílgamel at Haerondir.\n",
[7832]="70040E07\n1\tDestroy rowing boats\tRowing boats can be found on the shore at Hashadîr, south of Dol Amroth. You should compromise the rowing boats' ability to float.\n2\tDestroy the bottoms of rowing boats (total: 6)\tRowing boats can be found on the shore at Hashadîr, south of Dol Amroth. You should compromise the rowing boats' ability to float.\n3\tFind the last rowing boat, and use it to get to the tall ships\tThe last rowing boat can be found on the shore at Hashadîr, south of Dol Amroth. You should find the last rowing boat, and take it to the tall ships anchored offshore.\n4\tCompletado\tThe last rowing boat can be found on the shore at Hashadîr, south of Dol Amroth. You should take the last rowing boat to the tall ships anchored offshore.\n",
[7833]="700698B9\n1\tHabla con Ransroth\tHabla con Ransroth.\n",
[7834]="7002F174\n1\tHabla con Egg\tAl completar esta misión, recibirás un conjunto de equipo de paisaje.\n",
[7835]="70047B43\n1\tDefeat foes in Lang Rhuven (total: 20)\tMany foes can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad. You should defeat the enemies in Lang Rhuven.\n2\tReturn to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\n",
[7836]="70047B42\n1\tDefeat cat-masters (total: 6)\030Defeat battle-cats (total: 12)\tCat-masters and battle-cats can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad. You should defeat cat-masters and battle-cats found in Lang Rhuven.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated many cat-masters and battle-cats in Lang Rhuven.\n",
[7837]="70047B47\n1\tDestroy groups of tents in Lang Rhuven (total: 15)\030Destroy banners in Lang Rhuven (total: 15)\tEasterling tents and banners can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad. You should destroy tents and banners found in Lang Rhuven.\n2\tReturn to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\n",
[7838]="70047B3F\n1\tDefeat Uruk emissaries (total: 8)\030Defeat the Black Númenórean ambassador (cantidad: según el diario)\tUruk emissaries and the Black Númenórean ambassador can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad. You should defeat Uruk emissaries and the Black Númenórean ambassador found in Lang Rhuven.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated the Uruk emissaries and the Black Númenórean ambassador.\n",
[7839]="70047B45\n1\tFind the horses\tHorses can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad. You should free the horses in Lang Rhuven.\n2\tFree the horses in Lang Rhuven\tHorses can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad. You should free the horses in Lang Rhuven.\n3\tFree the horses in Lang Rhuven\tFreed the horses in Lang Rhuven.\n4\tReturn to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\n",
[7840]="70047B44\n1\tDefeat Khundolar tower-guards (total: 15)\tTower-guards can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad. You should defeat tower-guards found in Lang Rhuven.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated many Khundolar tower-guards at Lang Rhuven.\n",
})
